## T-010a — Actions-cell standartlashtirish + filter, 1-guruh

**Holat:** ACCEPTED (dizayn qarori keyinroq TUZATILDI)

**Tekshiruv:** AGY 3 sahifaga (advances, holidays, salary-adjustments)
filter + SVG edit+delete tugmalarini to'g'ri qo'shdi, `npm run build`
xatosiz o'tdi.

**Muhim keyingi tuzatish (foydalanuvchi topgan):** T-009'da "kanonik
actions-cell = edit+delete SVG" deb belgilangan qaror NOTO'G'RI edi.
Foydalanuvchi aniqlashtirdi: qator (`<tr>`) allaqachon `onRowClick`
orqali edit sahifasiga o'tadi, shuning uchun alohida edit tugmasi
ORTIQCHA. `design-reference.md` bo'lim 3.3 tuzatildi (endi faqat
delete tugmasi kanonik), va quyidagi barcha fayllardan edit tugmasi
qo'lda olib tashlandi: employee-list (T-009 qo'shgan), advance-list/
holiday-list/adjustment-list (T-010a qo'shgan), branch-list/
company-list (avvaldan mavjud edi), department-list/position-list
(matn/emoji'dan SVG delete-only'ga), terminal-list (matn'dan SVG
delete-only'ga), payroll-list ("Batafsil" havolasi butunlay olib
tashlandi, Amallar ustuni bilan birga — chunki qator bosilishi ham
xuddi shu joyga o'tardi).

`npm run build` yakuniy holatda ham xatosiz.

**Sana:** 2026-07-26
